  "findings": [
    "Guest-paravirtualization off took effect (serial changed Hyper-V detection to VMware/frequency reporting), but four-vCPU reboot still paused with exit4.",
    "Combined software IRQ plus guest-paravirtualization off at four vCPU also paused with exit4; no candidate correction is supported.",
    "A legitimate custom one-vCPU intent retained8192MiB and original WHPX. It remained QMP-running in firmware after reboot without another Linux boot or authenticated READY; absence of exit4 is not success.",
